@host = http://localhost:8080

### Login as Editor
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "editor@securecms.local",
  "password": "Editor123!"
}

### Copy accessToken from login response
@token = paste-token-here

### List events
GET {{host}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create event
POST {{host}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "content.published",
  "message": "Landing page was published.",
  "severity": "info",
  "actor": "Eva Editor"
}

### Editor receives 403; an Admin token can delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/events/replace-event-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
